{title: 061 - God Is Here!}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #061 • ABBOT'S LEIGH • 8.7.8.7.8.6.8.7}
{lyricist: Fred Pratt Green}
{composer: Cyril V. Taylor}
{key: Db}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 61}
{meta: tune ABBOT'S LEIGH}
{meta: meter 8.7.8.7.8.6.8.7}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Db]God [Fm/Ab]is [Bbm]here [Db/Ab]as [Gb]we [Ab7/Gb]his [Bbm]people
[Bbm]meet to [Ebm]offer [Fm]praise [Gb]and prayer,
[Fm]may we [Bbm]find [Db/Ab]in [Gb]fuller [Bbm]measure
[Bbm]what it [Ebm]is in [Fm]Christ [Gb]we share.
[B]Here, [Db/Ab]as [Ebm]in the [B]world [Ab7]around [Gb]us,
[Ab]all [Bbm/F]our [Ab7/Eb]varied [Cdim]skills [Db]and [Fm]arts
[Db/F]wait the [Fm/Ab]coming [Ebm]of his [Db/F]Spirit
[Ebm]into open [Gb]minds [Db/Ab]and [Ab7]hearts.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Db]Here [Fm/Ab]are [Bbm]symbols [Gb]to [Ab7/Gb]remind [Gb/Db]us
[Bbm]of our [Ebm]lifelong [Fm]need [Gb]of grace;
[Fm]here are [Bbm]table, [Gb]font [Ab7/Gb]and [Bbm]pulpit;
[Bbm]here the [Ebm]Word has [Fm]central [Gb]place.
[B]Here [Db/Ab]in [Ebm]honesty [Ab7]of [Db]preaching,
[Ab]here [Bbm/F]in [Ab7/Eb]silence, [Cdim]as [Db]in [Fm]speech,
[Db/F]here in [Fm/Ab]newness [Ebm]and renewal,
[Ebm]God the Spirit [Db/F]comes to [Ab7]each.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Db]Here [Fm/Ab]our [Bbm]children [Gb]find [Ab7/Gb]a [Bbm]welcome
[Bbm]in the [Ebm]Shepherd's [Fm]flock [Gb]and fold.
[Fm]Here, as [Bbm]bread [Db/Ab]and [Gb]wine [Ab7/Gb]are [Bbm]taken,
[Bbm]Christ sustains [Ebm]us, [Fm]as [Gb]of old.
[B]Here [Db/Ab]the [Ebm]servants [B]of [Ab7]the [Db]Servant
[Ab]seek [Bbm/F]in [Ab7/Eb]worship [Cdim]to [Db]explore
[Db/F]what it [Fm/Ab]means [Bbm]in [Ebm]daily [Db/F]living
[Ebm]to believe [Db/F]and [Gb]to [Db/Ab]adore.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Db]Lord [Fm/Ab]of [Bbm]all, [Db/Ab]Church [Ab7/Gb]and [Bbm]Kingdom,
[Bbm]in an [Ebm]age of [Fm]change [Gb]and doubt,
[Fm]keep us [Bbm]faithful [Gb]to [Ab7/Gb]the [Bbm]Gospel,
[Bbm]help us [Ebm]work your [Fm]purpose [Gb]out.
[B]Here, [Db/Ab]in [Ebm]this day's [B]dedication,
[Ab]all [Bbm/F]we [Ab7/Eb]have [Gb/Db]to [Cdim]give, [Db]receive:
[Db/F]we, who [Fm/Ab]cannot [Ebm]live without [Db/Ab]you,
[Ebm]we adore [Db/F]you! [Gb]We [Db/Ab]believe!
{end_of_verse}
